                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <div class="ielts-listening-question-item"> • <span>Development of ''ghost kitchens’ for takeaway food</span><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">29</strong><select data-qnum="29" name="question_29" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 29 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. This is only relevant to young people.">A. This is only relevant to young people.</option><option value="B. This may have disappointing results.">B. This may have disappointing results.</option><option value="C. This already seems to be widespread.">C. This already seems to be widespread.</option><option value="D. Retailers should do more to encourage this.">D. Retailers should do more to encourage this.</option><option value="E. More financial support is needed for this.">E. More financial support is needed for this.</option><option value="F. Most people know little about this.">F. Most people know little about this.</option><option value="G. There should be stricter regulations about this.">G. There should be stricter regulations about this.</option><option value="H. This could be dangerous.">H. This could be dangerous.</option></select></span></div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <div class="ielts-listening-question-item"> • <span>Use of mushrooms for common health concerns</span><span class="ielts-inline-select-wrap"><strong class="ielts-q-badge">30</strong><select data-qnum="30" name="question_30" class="ielts-inline-select"><option value="">[ 30 ] Tanlang...</option><option value="A. This is only relevant to young people.">A. This is only relevant to young people.</option><option value="B. This may have disappointing results.">B. This may have disappointing results.</option><option value="C. This already seems to be widespread.">C. This already seems to be widespread.</option><option value="D. Retailers should do more to encourage this.">D. Retailers should do more to encourage this.</option><option value="E. More financial support is needed for this.">E. More financial support is needed for this.</option><option value="F. Most people know little about this.">F. Most people know little about this.</option><option value="G. There should be stricter regulations about this.">G. There should be stricter regulations about this.</option><option value="H. This could be dangerous.">H. This could be dangerous.</option></select></span></div></div>                                                                        <div class="options-dnd-panel dnd-panel dnd-panel--matching" data-dnd-group="152597">
